{"seq":2,"slug":"spm-modularization","title":"SPM 模块化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-architecture/modular-design/spm-modularization","wordCount":649,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"spm-模块化\">SPM 模块化</h1><p>Swift Package Manager（SPM）已成为 iOS 模块化的首选工具。本文介绍 Package.swift 配置、target 与 product 的关系、本地包引用以及 monorepo 下的 SPM 项目结构。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>SPM 把模块化拆解为「怎么声明一个包、包里有哪些可编译单元、这些单元如何被引用」三件事：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Package.swift</strong>：包的核心配置文件，声明名称、平台、产物与目标</li>\n<li><strong>Target</strong>：最小的可编译单元，是实际包含源码并参与编译的粒度</li>\n<li><strong>Product</strong>：对外发布的产物，由若干 Target 组合而成，供其他包引用</li>\n<li><strong>本地包引用</strong>：通过相对路径把同一仓库内的包接入工程，是 monorepo 的基础</li>\n</ul>\n<p>理解 <strong>Target vs Product</strong> 是关键：Target 决定「编译什么」，Product 决定「对外暴露什么」。一个 Product 可以包含多个 Target，而跨包依赖只能建立在 Product 上。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"package-swift-基础\">Package.swift 基础</h2><p>Package.swift 是 SPM 包的核心配置文件，定义了包的名称、平台、产物和目标：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"// swift-tools-version: 5.9&#10;import PackageDescription&#10;&#10;let package = Package(&#10;    name: &quot;FeatureHome&quot;,&#10;    platforms: [&#10;        .iOS(.v17)&#10;    ],&#10;    products: [&#10;        .library(&#10;            name: &quot;FeatureHome&quot;,&#10;            targets: [&quot;FeatureHome&quot;]&#10;        ),&#10;        .library(&#10;            name: &quot;FeatureHomeInterface&quot;,&#10;            targets: [&quot;FeatureHomeInterface&quot;]&#10;        )&#10;    ],&#10;    dependencies: [&#10;        .package(path: &quot;../CoreNetworking&quot;),&#10;        .package(path: &quot;../SharedUI&quot;)&#10;    ],&#10;    targets: [&#10;        .target(&#10;            name: &quot;FeatureHome&quot;,&#10;            dependencies: [&#10;                &quot;FeatureHomeInterface&quot;,&#10;                .product(name: &quot;CoreNetworking&quot;, package: &quot;CoreNetworking&quot;),&#10;                .product(name: &quot;SharedUI&quot;, package: &quot;SharedUI&quot;)&#10;            ]&#10;        ),&#10;        .target(&#10;            name: &quot;FeatureHomeInterface&quot;,&#10;            dependencies: []&#10;        ),&#10;        .testTarget(&#10;            name: &quot;FeatureHomeTests&quot;,&#10;            dependencies: [&quot;FeatureHome&quot;]&#10;        )&#10;    ]&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// swift-tools-version: 5.9</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PackageDescription</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> package</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Package</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"FeatureHome\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    platforms</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">iOS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(.v17)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    products</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">library</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"FeatureHome\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            targets</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"FeatureHome\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">library</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"FeatureHomeInterface\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            targets</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"FeatureHomeInterface\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    dependencies</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">package</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"../CoreNetworking\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">package</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"../SharedUI\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    targets</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">target</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"FeatureHome\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            dependencies</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">                \"FeatureHomeInterface\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">product</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CoreNetworking\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">package</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CoreNetworking\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">product</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SharedUI\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">package</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SharedUI\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">target</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"FeatureHomeInterface\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            dependencies</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">testTarget</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"FeatureHomeTests\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            dependencies</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"FeatureHome\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"target-与-product-的关系\">Target 与 Product 的关系</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    Package[&quot;Package(包)&quot;]&#10;    Package --&gt; Product1[&quot;Product: FeatureHome&quot;]&#10;    Package --&gt; Product2[&quot;Product: FeatureHomeInterface&quot;]&#10;    Product1 --&gt; Target1[&quot;Target: FeatureHome&quot;]&#10;    Product2 --&gt; Target2[&quot;Target: FeatureHomeInterface&quot;]&#10;    Target1 --&gt; Target2&#10;    Package --&gt; TestTarget[&quot;TestTarget: FeatureHomeTests&quot;]&#10;    TestTarget --&gt; Target1&#10;&#10;    classDef pkg fill:none,stroke:#F44336&#10;    classDef prod fill:none,stroke:#2196F3&#10;    classDef tgt fill:none,stroke:#4CAF50&#10;    classDef test fill:none,stroke:#FF9800&#10;&#10;    class Package pkg&#10;    class Product1,Product2 prod&#10;    class Target1,Target2 tgt&#10;    class TestTarget test\">graph TD\n    Package[\"Package(包)\"]\n    Package --&gt; Product1[\"Product: FeatureHome\"]\n    Package --&gt; Product2[\"Product: FeatureHomeInterface\"]\n    Product1 --&gt; Target1[\"Target: FeatureHome\"]\n    Product2 --&gt; Target2[\"Target: FeatureHomeInterface\"]\n    Target1 --&gt; Target2\n    Package --&gt; TestTarget[\"TestTarget: FeatureHomeTests\"]\n    TestTarget --&gt; Target1\n\n    classDef pkg fill:none,stroke:#F44336\n    classDef prod fill:none,stroke:#2196F3\n    classDef tgt fill:none,stroke:#4CAF50\n    classDef test fill:none,stroke:#FF9800\n\n    class Package pkg\n    class Product1,Product2 prod\n    class Target1,Target2 tgt\n    class TestTarget test</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Package</td>\n<td>SPM 包，一个独立的代码分发单元</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Product</td>\n<td>包对外暴露的产物（library 或 executable）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Target</td>\n<td>编译单元，包含源码文件和依赖声明</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TestTarget</td>\n<td>测试编译单元，依赖待测 target</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 一个 Package 可以包含多个 Product，每个 Product 可以聚合多个 Target，但 Target 之间不能循环依赖。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"本地包引用\">本地包引用</h2><p>在 monorepo 中使用相对路径引用本地包：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"dependencies: [&#10;    .package(path: &quot;../CoreNetworking&quot;),&#10;    .package(path: &quot;../CoreStorage&quot;),&#10;    .package(path: &quot;../SharedUI&quot;),&#10;    .package(path: &quot;../SharedModels&quot;),&#10;]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">dependencies</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">package</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"../CoreNetworking\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">package</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"../CoreStorage\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">package</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"../SharedUI\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">package</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"../SharedModels\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span></code></pre></div><p>在 Xcode 项目中添加本地包：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"File → Add Package Dependencies → Add Local...\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>File → Add Package Dependencies → Add Local...</span></span></code></pre></div><p>或在 <code>xcworkspace</code> 中直接拖入 Package 目录。本地包的修改会即时反映在主工程编译中，无需额外发布步骤。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"monorepo-spm-结构\">Monorepo SPM 结构</h2><p>推荐的 monorepo 目录结构：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"MyApp/&#10;├── App/&#10;│   ├── MyApp.xcodeproj&#10;│   └── Sources/&#10;├── Packages/&#10;│   ├── Feature/&#10;│   │   ├── FeatureHome/&#10;│   │   │   ├── Package.swift&#10;│   │   │   ├── Sources/&#10;│   │   │   │   ├── FeatureHome/&#10;│   │   │   │   └── FeatureHomeInterface/&#10;│   │   │   └── Tests/&#10;│   │   ├── FeatureProfile/&#10;│   │   └── FeatureSearch/&#10;│   ├── Core/&#10;│   │   ├── CoreNetworking/&#10;│   │   ├── CoreStorage/&#10;│   │   └── CoreAnalytics/&#10;│   └── Shared/&#10;│       ├── SharedUI/&#10;│       ├── SharedModels/&#10;│       └── SharedExtensions/&#10;└── Tuist/ (or project.yml 