d>学习成本</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>社区生态</td>\n<td>持续增长</td>\n<td>最成熟</td>\n<td>逐渐衰退</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Package.swift 通过 products/targets/dependencies 三层结构定义 SPM 包</li>\n<li>Product 是对外暴露的接口，Target 是编译单元，两者多对多关系</li>\n<li>本地包通过相对路径引用，支持即时编辑和编译</li>\n<li>Monorepo 结构推荐按 Feature/Core/Shared 分类组织 Packages 目录</li>\n<li>SPM 支持条件编译、资源处理等高级特性</li>\n<li>SPM 是当前 iOS 模块化的首选方案，官方支持和生态持续完善</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"SPM 模块化","id":"spm-模块化"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Package.swift 基础","id":"package-swift-基础"},{"level":2,"text":"Target 与 Product 的关系","id":"target-与-product-的关系"},{"level":2,"text":"本地包引用","id":"本地包引用"},{"level":2,"text":"Monorepo SPM 结构","id":"monorepo-spm-结构"},{"level":2,"text":"高级配置技巧","id":"高级配置技巧"},{"level":3,"text":"条件编译与平台适配","id":"条件编译与平台适配"},{"level":3,"text":"资源文件处理","id":"资源文件处理"},{"level":2,"text":"SPM 与其他工具对比","id":"spm-与其他工具对比"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"模块边界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-architecture/modular-design/module-boundaries"},"next":{"title":"二进制框架","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-architecture/modular-design/binary-frameworks"}}